              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This data deposit makes public a formal independence index of European Union (EU) agencies. All EU agencies that were a member of the EU Agencies Network (https://euagencies.eu/) at the time of data collection (2020) are included.</p><p>The deposit contains the following files:<br>- \"independence_scores.csv\": CSV file with the formal independence score of each EU agency.<br>- \"guidebook.docx\": Word file with the coding scheme and additional information.<br>- \"data.csv\": CSV file with original data that was used to produce  the formal independence scores.<br>- \"code.R\": R file with code used to produce the formal independence scores.</p><p>The data contained in \"data.csv\" is based on a manual coding of EU agencies' founding regulations. Annotated founding regulations are available upon request.</p><p>Note: Some EU agencies have undergone a name change recently (see guidebook). The names used in the data may no longer be accurate for all EU agencies.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
